**Use cases:**
- Disaster recovery (fire, theft, hardware failure)
- Offsite redundancy (geographic distribution)
- Privacy-preserving (encrypted, friend nodes can't read)
- Cost-effective (use friends' NAS instead of cloud)

**Rationale:** Self-hosted offsite backup, mutual aid network, reduce cloud dependency

